          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "fusion-traces"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "metricsQueryType": "range",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"${service:pipe}\" } | rate() by (resource.service.name)"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Traces of the application's services that reached the store. Needs the trace store's metrics generator, which this chart turns on (tempo.traceqlMetrics). Traces are matched by service name only: a trace can cross clusters, and spans that did not pass an Ikhnos agent carry no cluster id, so the cluster choice does not narrow them.",
